OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cold night
OL,6,Ffor many with clear spells producing a
OL,7,Fwidespread frost. Cloudier at the
OL,8,Fcoasts where temperatures are unlikely
OL,9,Fto drop as low. Winds picking up
OL,10,Faround Anglesey where the odd shower
OL,11,Fis possible during the evening.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FSaturday will dry for most
OL,14,Fwith the odd shower in the northwest.
OL,15,FTemperatures recover slightly but stay
OL,16,Flargely below average. Later on, winds
OL,17,Fpick up along coasts and over hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
