OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWet and
OL,6,Fblustery on Sunday, then a calmer,
OL,7,Fdrier interlude early Monday before
OL,8,Fmore rain arrives in the afternoon and
OL,9,Fwinds pick up again. Temperatures
OL,10,Fdropping through the period.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
